  <!-- 1. RINGKASAN EKSEKUTIF -->
  <h2>1. Ringkasan Eksekutif (Executive Summary)</h2>
  <div class="highlight-box">
    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 10pt;">
      <strong>Ibrahim, S.Kom.</strong> adalah seorang <em>Lead Web Architect, Senior Full Stack Developer, dan Instruktur Teknologi Profesional</em> dengan rekam jejak lebih dari <strong>7 tahun</strong> di industri rekayasa perangkat lunak web. Berpengalaman luas dalam merancang arsitektur sistem informasi enterprise, platform e-commerce multi-vendor skala besar, integrasi Payment Gateway & Webhook, serta RESTful API standar internasional.
    </p>
    <p style="margin: 6pt 0 0 0; font-size: 10pt;">
      Selain aktif sebagai konsultan dan developer pengembang web, Ibrahim telah mendedikasikan waktu lebih dari 5 tahun melatih lebih dari <strong>500 mahasiswa, fresh graduate, dan karyawan korporat</strong> dalam program training pemrograman web intensif, mencetak tenaga ahli yang siap terjun langsung ke industri teknologi. Memiliki komitmen tinggi pada <em>Clean Code, SOLID Principles, Keamanan Aplikasi (OWASP Top 10), High Performance, dan Skalabilitas</em>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- 2. KOMPETENSI INTI & TEKNOLOGI -->
  <h2>2. Kompetensi Inti & Keahlian Teknis (Tech Stacks)</h2>
  <table class="bordered">
    <tr>
      <th width="28%">Domain / Kategori</th>
      <th width="72%">Teknologi, Tools & Standar Industri</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Backend Engineering</strong></td>
      <td>
        PHP 8.2 / 8.3 / 8.4, <strong>Laravel Ecosystem (Laravel 10, 11, 12)</strong>, Eloquent ORM, Service Layer Pattern, Repository Pattern, Middleware Architecture, Event & Listener, Job Queues, Task Scheduling, Artisan CLI, Composer.
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Frontend Development</strong></td>
      <td>
        JavaScript (ES6+), TypeScript, Vue.js, Alpine.js, <strong>Tailwind CSS</strong>, Blade Templating Engine, Bootstrap 5, Vite Bundler, Responsive Web Design, CSS3 Parallax, Web Accessibility (a11y).
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Database & Caching</strong></td>
      <td>
        <strong>MySQL, PostgreSQL, SQLite, Redis</strong>, Database Normalization, Indexing Strategy, Query Optimization, Foreign Key Constraints, Transactions & Locking, Migrations & Database Seeding.
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>API & Third-Party Integration</strong></td>
      <td>
        RESTful API Architecture, JSON:API, OAuth2, JWT Authentication, <strong>Payment Gateway (Midtrans, Xendit, Stripe, PayPal)</strong>, Kemenkes SATUSEHAT API, RajaOngkir Logistik, WhatsApp Business Gateway, Google Maps Geocoding API.
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Server, Cloud & DevOps</strong></td>
      <td>
        Linux (Ubuntu Server, Debian), Nginx, Apache HTTP Server, Docker & Docker Compose, Git & GitHub Actions (CI/CD), SSL/TLS Let's Encrypt, CPanel/WHM, Laravel Cloud, VPS Deployment (DigitalOcean, Linode, AWS EC2).
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Keamanan & Pengujian (QA)</strong></td>
      <td>
        PHPUnit Testing Suite, Feature & Unit Tests, OWASP Top 10 Mitigation (CSRF, XSS, SQL Injection Prevention, Secure Cookie, Content Security Policy), Laravel Pint Code Formatter, Rate Limiting, Brute-force Protection.
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Metodologi & Soft Skills</strong></td>
      <td>
        Agile / Scrum, Git Flow Collaboration, Technical Mentoring & Public Speaking, Code Review, Problem Solving, Client Requirement Gathering, Technical Documentation Writing.
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

